## What each criterion rests on

- **Account** (deliverable 1): `results/account.csv`, FINDINGS.md §2–3 — every phase × every
  route class, with verdict, mechanism or reason, A_max and Br_max.
- **Tests** (deliverable 2): FINDINGS.md §5 — one measurement per cell, with the outcome that
  would refute it.
- **Documents and one command** (deliverable 3): FINDINGS.md, REPORT.md and this file are
  written by `./regenerate.sh`, which also re-scores every prediction (`results/scores_v1.json`,
  `results/scores_v2.json`); `./regenerate.sh --verify` re-checks every source and quote online.
- **Fidelity**: REPORT.md, Fidelity; FINDINGS.md §4 record by record.
- **Accuracy**: REPORT.md, Accuracy — the frozen predictions (v1) against held-out outcomes
  that were sealed (encrypted, hashed) until after the freeze (docs/PROTOCOL_LOG.md); post-hoc
  revisions are reported separately and never counted as held-out.
- **Frontier**: REPORT.md, Frontier — non-dominated versions and the criterion pushed next.
- **Limits**: REPORT.md, Limits — every open cell names the unpublished quantity, its effect on
  the ceiling and the measurement that settles it; every cell that cannot align names its
  physical reason.
- **Evidence**: REPORT.md, Evidence; FINDINGS.md §8 — every input number with its source,
  quote check and evidence level.

